  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Chastising Shot",
          "desc": "Basic Attack hits grant Attack Speed and 1 stack of enhancement.At 3 stacks, enhanced Basic Attacks shoot 3 arrows, dealing more totaldamage than a regular Basic Attack."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Arrow Volley",
          "desc": "Enhances Basic Attacks for 5s to deal heavy damage. At the same time, HouYi shoots arrows to hit two other enemies in front of him, dealing 50%damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Afterglow",
          "desc": "Inflicts damage and slow on enemies in the target area while also gaining vision of the area."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Burning Sun Arrow",
          "desc": "Fires an arrow in the target direction. Deals AoE damage upon hitting a hero inflicting stun and slow."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Global Ultimate that can catch enemies",
          "Excellent late game scaling",
          "Easy to play"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "No Mobility",
          "Weak Early Game",
          "Relies on team to peel for him"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nFocus on farming and last-hitting minions to maximize the amount of gold you get during the early game. Once you reach Level 4, you can look to use Burning Sun Arrow to stun enemies.\n\n## Teamfights\nPositioning is key. Stay behind your team in fights; stay at maximum attack range so you don't get jumped on by assassins. Always keep an eye on the map for targets to hit with Burning Sun Arrow. Your Ultimate is a gamechanging and stunning a key target can win you the game.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nSave your Skill 1 Arrow Volley until you have reached maximum stacks of your passive for maximum damage output\nBurning Sun Arrow is a global Ultimate, meaning it can go across the whole map, giving you opportunities to help other lanes\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "Hou Yi tipis banget dan susah nyelametin diri. Pas nyerang perhatiin posisi. Kalau bahaya jangan basic attack, serang dari jauh pakai skill 2."
    },
    {
      "source": "HoKStats",
